<section id="about">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <h2 class="section-title">About me</h2>
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          I'm a software engineer based in Bergamo, Italy, specialized in embedded systems and E-Mobility software.
          I hold a Master's degree in Computer Engineering from the University of Bergamo and have been
          working in the industry since 2022.
        </p>
        <p>
          My core expertise is in <strong>Embedded Linux</strong> - from writing C++ applications to building
          custom Linux distributions with Yocto and Buildroot. I've led teams developing software for
          electric vehicle charging stations (EVSE), working across the full stack from hardware abstraction
          to OCPP cloud communication.
        </p>
        <p>
          I enjoy tackling complex technical challenges and find satisfaction in building reliable,
          well-structured systems.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

